#* {{quote-journal|en|year=1880|volume=[[wikisource:The Pearl/Volume 12|12]]|work={{w|The Pearl (magazine)|The Pearl}}|title=Lady Pokingham, or They All Do It|passage=He forced his prick between her reluctant lips, all slimy and soiled as it was from the previous enculade, then producing an enormous dildoe, nearly twelve inches long, and big in proportion, he put a little cold cream on it, and presented the head to her '''notch''', trying to force it in.<br/>“Ah! No! no! that's so awfully large!” she almost screamed, but the head was partly in, and despite her sobs: and moans of pains, he soon succeeded in passing at least ten inches of it into her distended vagina.}}
#* {{quote-journal|en|year=1880|volume=[[wikisource:The Pearl/Volume 16|16]]|work={{w|The Pearl (magazine)|The Pearl}}|title=La Rose D'Amour|passage=It was some time ere I recovered myself, and then it was through the teasings and ticklings of my lovely tormentors. I had a pallet made on the floor of the cabin from the beds in the staterooms, and putting the lights out, we lay down. I was in the arms of Isabel and soon well repaid her for the pleasure she had given just before.<br/>Thrice did I spend into the most secret recesses of her '''notch''' the warm and generous fluid which acts so powerfully on women, and then composed myself for sleep.}}
# {{lb|en|US|_|slang}} A [[woman]].
